formula.en:
def sort_waste(item):
    if item == "banana peel" or item == "vegetable peel":
        return "wet waste bin (green)"
    elif item == "plastic bottle" or item == "chips packet":
        return "dry waste bin (blue)"
    else:
        return "ask the teacher"

for thing in ["banana peel", "plastic bottle", "old battery"]:
    print(thing, "->", sort_waste(thing))

Output:
banana peel -> wet waste bin (green)
plastic bottle -> dry waste bin (blue)
old battery -> ask the teacher

